# Version Control (Strict SemVer)

Follow [SemVer 2.0.0](https://semver.org/): `MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` (e.g. `v0.1.0`).

| Bump | When |
|------|------|
| **PATCH** | Bug fixes, i18n tweaks; no schema/API change |
| **MINOR** | New features; backward-compatible migrations |
| **MAJOR** | Breaking migrations, removed features, incompatible backups |

Pre-1.0.0 (`0.x.y`) is expected while evolving — still bump deliberately.

## Sync versions across

- `package.json`
- `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`
- `CHANGELOG.md`

## Commits

Conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `chore:`, `docs:`

**One logical change per commit** — do not bundle unrelated refactors with features.
